    {
      "type": "text",
      "label": "The idea",
      "title": "Wildlife and habitat are one picture.",
      "body": "A visual representation of the interconnectedness between wildlife and their habitats, and a reminder of the delicate balance of our ecosystems.\n\nUsing Stable Diffusion and its ControlNet feature, I made landscapes that blend the essence of iconic creatures with their natural environments."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "label": "The method",
      "title": "Start from a silhouette, grow a landscape.",
      "body": "The control images are plain black-and-white silhouettes: a bear, a camel, an elephant and a rhino. Each generated landscape sits next to the shape it was built from, so you can see how the creature's outline organises the terrain."
